msgctxt "144"
msgid ""
"Wow, your body is totally relaxed! That makes it so much easier for me to "
"give you the perfect massage. How do you feel? Refreshed, revitalized?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "I'm so glad to hear that. Okay, let me walk you out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "Thank you very much. Please come again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid ""
"Next time, try to relax a little more. You'll never make it to the end if "
"you stay all tensed up like that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid ""
"You're, like, totally exhausted, huh? You sure you're feeling okay? I mean, "
"you fell asleep right in the middle of the massage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid "Thank you very much. See you again soon!"
msgstr ""

